    "section": "II. Streaking for singles: rapid serial purification of viruses from plaques - <strong>Streak 1 (Day 1)</strong>",
    "section_color": "#94EBFF",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "**Make overlay -** Swirl vigorously\u00a0but briefly to mix the bacteria and molten top agar and spread it across the plate.\n ",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 8175,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
